\title{Research-state compaction and observability}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{research-state}
\tag{compaction}

\p{A research harness cannot place its complete archive into every model
invocation. A summary can make distinct archives indistinguishable to later
evaluators. The source record of a lost evaluator caveat illustrates how
omitted information can affect subsequent research.}

